    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "After years of crafting the case under gatekeeper rules, rule-crafters shaping the digital marketplace deemed the company's patchwork solutions flawed. They are now shaping a landmark financial sanction against the search algorithm architects for fabricating a biased search interface that prioritized their own curated products over rival comparison platforms. This antitrust fine, expected before the August recess, will add to a decade of regulatory punishment, building a legacy of precedent in digital regulation.",
