    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "Brussels, the administrative center for competition law enforcement, has finalized its stance: a record-setting monetary sanction is being composed against the parent engineering conglomerate. This action, anticipated soon, stems from fabricating a biased search interface that crowded out creators, representing the latest in a series of antitrust fines to restore competitive market dynamics.",
